Network services (queried at runtime; nothing redistributed):

- AniList GraphQL API - https://anilist.co - queried only when the user
  searches for or picks a series in the optional series-names feature
  (config key gazetteer.enabled). Series metadata and cover images are
  fetched at the user's request and cached locally on the user's
  machine; they are not redistributed with Yamabiko. Cover artwork
  remains the property of its rights holders. Yamabiko is an unofficial
  API consumer and is not affiliated with or endorsed by AniList.

